@hote = http://localhost:5224
@accessToken = coller-le-token-de-la-reponse-de-connexion

### Santé
GET {{hote}}/api/sante

### Inscription
POST {{hote}}/api/auth/inscription
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mathieu@example.bf",
  "motDePasse": "MotDePasseSolide2026",
  "nomComplet": "Mathieu Kaboré",
  "telephone": "+226 70 00 00 00",
  "devise": "XOF",
  "appareil": "Samsung A14 · Android 14"
}

### Connexion
POST {{hote}}/api/auth/connexion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mathieu@example.bf",
  "motDePasse": "MotDePasseSolide2026",
  "appareil": "Samsung A14 · Android 14"
}

### Profil
GET {{hote}}/api/auth/moi
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Comptes
GET {{hote}}/api/comptes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Créer un compte Orange Money
POST {{hote}}/api/comptes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Orange Money",
  "type": "mobile_money",
  "institution": "Orange Burkina",
  "soldeInitial": 25000,
  "couleur": "#ffb400",
  "icone": "phone"
}

### Catégories (arborescence)
GET {{hote}}/api/categories?type=depense&arborescence=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Enregistrer une dépense
POST {{hote}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "depense",
  "montant": 3500,
  "compteId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "categorieId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "libelle": "Courses au marché",
  "tiers": "Marché de Gounghin",
  "modePaiement": "especes"
}

### Transfert entre comptes
POST {{hote}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "transfert",
  "montant": 50000,
  "compteId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "compteDestinationId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "libelle": "Virement vers épargne"
}

### Fil des transactions du mois
GET {{hote}}/api/transactions?debut=2026-09-01&fin=2026-09-30&page=1&taillePage=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Budget mensuel Alimentation
POST {{hote}}/api/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Alimentation",
  "categorieId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "montantPlafond": 120000,
  "periode": "mensuelle",
  "seuilAlerte": 80
}

### Budgets en alerte
GET {{hote}}/api/budgets/alertes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Objectif d'épargne
POST {{hote}}/api/objectifs
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Moto Sanili",
  "montantCible": 750000,
  "dateEcheance": "2027-06-30",
  "icone": "target",
  "couleur": "#ffb400"
}

### Récurrence : loyer mensuel
POST {{hote}}/api/recurrences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "libelle": "Loyer",
  "type": "depense",
  "montant": 75000,
  "compteId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "frequence": "mensuelle",
  "jourDuMois": 5,
  "autoGenerer": true
}

### Générer les échéances échues
POST {{hote}}/api/recurrences/generer
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Tableau de bord
GET {{hote}}/api/statistiques/tableau-de-bord
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Répartition des dépenses
GET {{hote}}/api/statistiques/par-categorie?type=depense
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Évolution sur 12 mois
GET {{hote}}/api/statistiques/evolution?granularite=mois
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
